WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.790
In Tidy, you can track urgent work by adding tasks with high priority.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.330
Type what needs doing in the box at the top.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:13.070
From the Priority menu, select High.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:18.810
Click Add task to place it on your list with a red High badge.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:23.350
When the work is done, tick the checkbox to cross it off.
